pplication must never be deployed or exposed. Six tests execute only `SafeCalculator`; no vulnerable endpoint is run. All credential-like values are synthetic placeholders.\n\n## Evidence to inspect\n\n- CodeQL security check and code-scanning alerts\n- `CodeQL - Code Quality / Analyze` and `github-code-quality[bot]` comments\n- built-in coverage comment and raw Cobertura artifact\n- dependency review\n- merge box/ruleset decision\n\nSee `docs/SCENARIO-MATRIX.md`, `docs/GITHUB-NATIVE.md`, and `docs/EVIDENCE.md`.","created_at":"2026-08-18T05:45:13Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T05:46:42Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"4621cc1b8a081c2a124dcf5e60180b9380d87c66","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ms-pwc/github-code-quality/pulls/1/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ms-pwc/github-code-quality/pulls/1/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ms-pwc/github-code-quality/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ms-pwc/github-code-quality/issues/1/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ms-pwc/github-code-quality/statuses/03a1e68af7d47f9597d9737c3f51ad911eba1f9d","head":{"label":"ms-pwc:github-native-poc","ref":"github-native-poc","sha":"03a1e68af7d47f9597d9737c3f51ad911eba1f9d","user":{"login":"ms-pwc","id":264451220,"node_id":"O_kgDOD8M0lA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264451220?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ms-pwc","html_url":"https://github.com/ms-pwc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ms-pwc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ms-pwc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ms-pwc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ms-pwc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ms-pwc/subscriptions","